          {
            "t": "Share the fire",
            "fx": {
              "food": 120
            },
            "flag": "generous",
            "log": "You shared the first fire. The strangers stayed, and they remembered."
          },
          {
            "t": "Take their flint by force",
            "fx": {
              "gold": 100,
              "stone": 120
            },
            "flag": "ruthless",
            "log": "You took the flint. The strangers did not stay, but your stores grew."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Chapter II — Metal and Debt",
        "d": "The smelters work day and night. A trader from downriver offers a shipment on credit, with terms you cannot read.",
        "ch": [
          {
            "t": "Sign the terms",
            "fx": {
